#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:17
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since 4.0, Krita has a new palette file-format that can handle colors that "
"are wide gamut, RGB, CMYK, XYZ, GRAY, or LAB, and can be of any of the "
"available bitdepths, as well as groups. These are Krita Palettes, or ``*."
"kpl``."
msgstr ""
"Od 4.0, Krita ima nov paletni format datoteke, ki lahko obravnava barve, ki "
"so široka gamut, RGB, CMYK, XYZ, GRAY, ali LAB, in je lahko od katerega koli "
"od razpoložljivih bitdepths, kot tudi skupine. To so Krita Palettes, ali ''*."
"kpl''."

#: ../../general_concepts/file_formats/file_kpl.rst:19
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``*.kpl`` files are ZIP files, with two XMLs and ICC profiles inside. The "
"*colorset.xml* file contains the swatches as ColorSetEntry and Groups as "
"Group. The *profiles.xml* file contains a list of profiles, and the ICC "
"profiles themselves are embedded to ensure compatibility over different "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"''*.kpl'' datoteke so ZIP datoteke, v njej pa sta dva XML in ICC profila. "
"Datoteka *colorset.xml* vsebuje swatchese kot ColorSetEntry in Skupine kot "
"skupine. Datoteka *profiles.xml* vsebuje seznam profilov, sami profili ICC "
"pa so vgrajeni, da zagotovijo združljivost nad različnimi računalniki."

